msgstr "The monthly layer: wages, prices and unemployment from Rosstat’s bulletin, mortgages and loans from the Bank of Russia, small and medium-sized businesses from the Federal Tax Service register. Value kind: level — for the month or at its end, ytd — year to date, yoy — against the same period a year earlier."

