msgstr "Source code and texts"

#: apps/core/templates/core/terms.html:314
msgid "Тексты методики и глоссария можно цитировать со ссылкой на сайт."
msgstr "The texts of the methodology and glossary may be quoted with a reference to the site."

#: apps/core/templates/core/terms.html:319
#: apps/core/templates/core/terms.html:365
