msgstr "Small multiples: each federal subject’s cell shows the indicator from %(first)s to %(last)s. The scale is shared by all cells — from %(low)s to %(high)s; the dot is the selected year in the colour of its scale class."

#: apps/maps/templates/maps/partials/_map_surface.html:58
